    - rid: 3046479087689794079
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479087689794080
    - rid: 3046479087689794080
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Which is why you should stay away. We can''t afford to have
          people going around asking questions like that.

          Need I remind
          you that the whole reason why this works is the fact the <b>he</b> doesn''t
          know?

          I''m not going to risk it... I don''t want to keep working
          for them. This is my way out, so please, step aside.'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 4
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479087689794081
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3684.2007, y: 29.00001}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 1053840211
          Part2: 1083319245
          Part3: 2245772943
          Part4: 1085929645
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479087689794081
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[If you say so. (What''s he up to...?)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4458.7773, y: 29.000002}
    - rid: 3046479087689794082
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479087689794083
    - rid: 3046479087689794083
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: '...in a way, yes. Which is why you should probably not get
          too involved in this.

          I''m here to complete a task, my last
          task... and I''m no longer going to doubt if I have to... change my "objectives".'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 6
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479087689794084
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3749, y: 577.5}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 1619960445
          Part2: 1120043846
          Part3: 3301554071
          Part4: 3045703875
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479087689794084
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[(What''s going on here...?)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4539, y: 578}
    - rid: 3046479087689794085
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479087689794086
    - rid: 3046479087689794086
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: '...heh... yeah, you could say that. You see, we''ve done a
          lot of... "work" together and, while he was never too bright, I managed
          to... train him well.

          Thing is, I have... fallen out of love
          with the work I do, and with our... "boss"... but, see, that''s not something
          I can tell him without... hurting him.

          Luckily, if things go
          right, this should be the last time we work together. I''m looking forward
          to... "retirement".'
        characterEmotion: 4
        characterReaction: 6
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479087689794087
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 2279.7, y: 422.81958}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2323406998
          Part2: 1218302688
          Part3: 831922608
          Part4: 2915300154
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479087689794087
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '["This"? So you''re working right now?]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 3046479087689794088
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3335.9, y: 518.95}
    - rid: 3046479087689794088
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: '...in a way, yes. Which is why you should probably not get
          too involved in this.

          I''m here to complete a task, my last
          task... and I''m no longer going to doubt if I have to... change my "objectives".'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 6
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479087689794084
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3749, y: 577.5}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2824955012
          Part2: 1279284701
          Part3: 1091494021
          Part4: 164643856
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479087689794089
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479087689794090
    - rid: 3046479087689794090
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'What? That... doesn''t make any sense.

          Unless...
          oh no, was he scolding me for not doing my research properly?

          I
          swear i found everything I could about that guy... wait... I mean... science!
          We''re scientist doing research, that''s what I meant... um... yeah.'
        characterEmotion: 5
        characterReaction: 0
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479087689794091
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3102.5059, y: 810.482}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 819083234
          Part2: 1127784163
          Part3: 3202057864
          Part4: 419177761
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479087689794091
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[(I doubt you''ve researched Oleg "for science"...)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3970, y: 810}
    - rid: 3046479087689794092
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[Item, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f243d9958ead79545b599d03db2e8738, type: 2}
    - rid: 3046479087689794093
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479087689794094
    - rid: 3046479087689794094
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: "Oh, no, I cannot allow that, sir... even if I could get in,
          \nI wouldn't want to limit your experience here, but you have to understand:
          right now, it's not safe to go in without the right protection.\nThe temperature
          could be way off, a pipe could be perforated and leaking who-knows-what...
          it could be <b>fatal</b> if I let anyone in right now."
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479087689794095
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3325.0005, y: 621}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 1312874833
          Part2: 1083797283
          Part3: 1729374135
          Part4: 4018056731
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479087689794095
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[Makes sense. Thank you for warning me.]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4245, y: 621}
    - rid: 3046479087689794099
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479087689794100
    - rid: 3046479087689794100
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: '...y-yes, I''ve also... come to realize that from some...
          "constructive criticism" that I''ve received from some guests.

          Once
          again, I''m pretty sure I did hang the "closed" sign there... and yet it''s
          n-nowhere to be seen right now... (Gosh, am I really that distracted?)

          I-I
          swear this is not normal, sir, I''m usually a much more reliable host...
          please, don''t leave...'
        characterEmotion: 5
        characterReaction: 6
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479087689794101
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4636.355, y: 1222.0001}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2527546405
          Part2: 1157426369
          Part3: 980640142
          Part4: 721459554
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479087689794101
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[(What''s going on with that sign?)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 5546, y: 1217.1599}
    - rid: 3046479087689794102
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479087689794103
    - rid: 3046479087689794103
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Well, you''re the first and only person to come into this
          room, and the door to "the place" is still closed, so nothing''s gone wrong
          so far.

          Though, of course, I didn''t account on you being a
          part of this so, please don''t get in the way.

          This is a very
          serious business for me, alright?'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 6
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479087689794104
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 2239, y: -573.1084}
